# Stolen Dignity (Q386), level 58, quest started with 100 ore: a pick of six cells that completes no line pays ten of a reward. Untraced: the reference scrambles the board with an unseeded shuffle, so the random line pins the eight scramble draws (all 0 give the board 234567891) and the expected pages are the datapack pages filled by the reference algorithm.
character Pastime 58
quest Q386_StolenDignity <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
hold 6363 100
random 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 21
script quest.Q386_StolenDignity
item 6363 5529 5534 5536 8346
page warehouse/30843.htm
