  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=romp item=0 html="<html><body>Warehouse Keeper Romp:<br>\nYou are a seriously unlucky person! Your choices are in red on the bingo pad below. As you can see, you didn't even make a single line! You know, that's actually harder to do than to complete all 3 lines.<br>\nUsually, we only reward winners, but I want to do something nice for you to keep your spirits up.<br>\nHere, take this. I hope it helps!<br>\n<table border=\"1\" border color=\"white\" width=100>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">2</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">3</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">4</font></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">5</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">6</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">7</font></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">8</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ff0000\">9</font></td>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\"><font color=\"ffffff\">1</font></td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n</body></html>\n"
